== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[fimm]]'' "[[five]]". Meaning '''twenty and five'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''tuttugu og fimm''' {{indecl}}

# [[twenty-five]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu og fjórir]] and before [[tuttugu og sex]]

